    "text": "<p>Some reactions of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;relevant to photochemical smog formation are</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0019_4053c945d4a1.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>Identify <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math></p>"
  },
